										<P>
											<span id="dl_news__ctl2_Label1"><font color="White">Klandicar Round 2...<BR><BR>FIGHT!<BR><IMG src="http://home.mchsi.com/~serendipitousexistence/KlanCorpse.jpg"><BR>Get on the ground you ugly ass clown.<BR><BR>Gratz Wopa on our first sleepers key awarding. Gratz Pyrain on Peerless BP.<BR><BR>Also killed Vindicator again like clockwork. Gratz Panegyvver on your boots.<BR><BR>later<BR><BR>-sani <BR><BR></font></span></P>
